# Live: MODIFY > Physical Material, as the familiar material browser: New...
# opens the Material Editor; name it, set its density, Save; it is listed
# under My Materials and picked; Apply gives it to the body.
waitfor tsr.feature.extrude
wait 600
menu panel.Modify ui.physicalMaterial
waitfor materialList
wait 400
click materialNew
waitfor materialName
wait 300
click materialName
key ctrl+a
type Carbon Fibre
click materialDensity
key ctrl+a
type 1.6
wait 300
shot /tmp/live_material_editor.png
click materialSave
wait 600
shot /tmp/live_material_library.png
click materialApply
wait 800
